TI  - Siamese neural networks for continuous disease severity evaluation and change detection in medical imaging
AU  - Matthew Li
AU  - Ken Chang
AU  - Benjamin Bearce
AU  - Connie Y. Chang
AU  - Ambrose J. Huang
AU  - J. Peter Campbell
AU  - James M. Brown
AU  - Praveer Singh
